cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the ICOKG 2026 chapter below."
title: "Dimensional Data Warehouse for Geospatial Monitoring of Municipal Public Works"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and reproducibility artefacts for the ICOKG 2026 book
  chapter. It includes the dimensional warehouse DDL (ten dimensions, five of them
  SCD Type 2, two fact tables, five analytical views), SCD 2 synchronisation
  triggers, seeded synthetic-data generators, the detection evaluation protocol,
  and a serverless GitHub Pages demonstration whose credentials are published
  openly: it runs entirely from a synthetic dataset scoped to the visitor's own
  browser tab, so it has no shared state to protect. The demonstration is
  bilingual (Spanish and English), ships two colour themes each with a light
  and a dark mode, and includes a copy of the Smart Map geospatial viewer
  that needs no backend.
